<h2>Part 7F. When to Travel</h2>
<p>The cooler months, from November to February, suit almost every destination. Summer, from March to May, favours hill stations such as Ooty and Coorg over the hot plains of Hampi. Monsoon, from June to September, brings green landscapes and waterfalls but slower roads, and the best plan is to build slack into the schedule. For weddings and festivals, book early, because the most comfortable vehicles are the first to go.</p>

